  "You and Elise ended it in the year that tested everyone. Nobody shouted. Nobody posted anything. You said thank you, and meant it.\nA year later she sends a photo from her dance academy in Seoul. You send one back from your own first real step with {passion}. You're both, quietly, better people than the two kids who met in JC1.\nMochi: \"Ending well is still love. You lost a girlfriend, not yourself.\"": "在那个考验每个人的一年，你和伊莉丝分开了。没有人大吵。没有人发帖。你说了谢谢，而且是真心的。\n一年后，她传来一张她在首尔的舞蹈学院的照片。你回传一张你在{passion}上踏出第一步的照片。你们两个都悄悄地，比当年初院一年级认识的那两个小孩更好了。\n麻糬：“好好结束，也是爱。你失去的是女朋友，不是你自己。”",
  "★ Best End": "★ 最佳结局",
  "Your grades got you where you wanted. {passion} turned into something real: a first gig, a first show, a first release. You sleep. You save. You're kind to your family and honest with everyone.\nWhoever you're with, or not with, you're a whole person. People notice that, without you ever trying to impress them.\nMochi: \"The secret all along: love doesn't complete you. You show up complete, and share.\"": "成绩带你去了你想去的地方。{passion}变成了真的东西：第一场演出、第一次展览、第一次发表。你有睡觉。你有存钱。你对家人好，对每个人都诚实。\n不管你身边有没有人，你都是一个完整的人。别人看得出来，你根本不用刻意去讨好谁。\n麻糬：“秘密一直都是这个：爱不会让你变完整。是你本来就完整，然后去分享。”",
  "Lesson End": "教训结局",
  "Side Character in Your Own Life": "自己人生里的配角",
  "You gave everything to love: your grades, your sleep, your savings, {passion}. Somewhere along the way you became a supporting role in someone else's story, and then not even that.\nNot a punishment. A mirror. Nobody can love someone who isn't there.\nMochi: \"New Game+, rookie. This time, play the main character. Hint: the main character has a life.\"": "你把一切都给了爱情：成绩、睡眠、存款、{passion}。不知不觉，你变成了别人故事里的配角，后来连配角都不是了。\n这不是惩罚。是一面镜子。一个不在场的人，没有人能爱。\n麻糬：“新游戏+，菜鸟。这次，演主角吧。提示：主角是有自己生活的。”",
  "Whole Person": "完整的人",
  "No girlfriend at the end of this story, and that's fine. You have friends who'd help you shift house, a passion that pays a little, legs that can run 5K, and a bank account that isn't on fire.\nAt a friend's book launch, someone laughs at the same moment you do. You talk for an hour. You get her number the normal way: by asking.\nMochi: \"Not a consolation prize. A head start.\"": "故事结束时没有女朋友，这也没关系。你有会帮你搬家的朋友、一个能赚一点钱的爱好、跑得完5公里的腿，还有一个没在烧的银行户头。\n在朋友的新书发布会上，有个人跟你同时笑出来。你们聊了一个小时。你用正常的方法拿到她的号码：开口问。\n麻糬：“这不是安慰奖。是领先起跑。”",
  "Still Searching": "还在找",
  "Alone, and not the good kind of alone yet. Some lessons stuck. Some didn't. You still check her stories sometimes.\nBut you're twenty-one. Nothing is decided. The chess uncles at the void deck have been losing to each other for forty years, and they still show up every evening.\nMochi: \"New Game+ starts now. I'm not giving up on you. Don't you dare give up on you.\"": "一个人，而且还不是好的那种一个人。有些课学进去了，有些没有。你有时还是会偷看她的限时动态。\n可是你才二十一岁。什么都还没定。组屋楼下那几个下棋的安哥，已经互相输了四十年，每天傍晚还是照样出现。\n麻糬：“新游戏+现在开始。我不会放弃你。你也不准放弃你自己。”",
  "Comic Good End": "搞笑好结局",
  "Prata Brothers": "煎饼兄弟",
  "You and Haziq go halves on a stall at the Seri Bayu hawker centre: \"Bro Prata\". The egg prata is excellent. The business plan was written on a tissue.\nIt works, mostly because you both actually turn up, do the books every Sunday, and never lend money to Ryan.\nMochi: \"Platonic love is still love. Also, I want plain prata. Fish curry. Free.\"": "你和哈齐克在斯里巴尤小贩中心合伙顶了一个档口：“兄弟煎饼”。鸡蛋煎饼一流。商业计划是写在纸巾上的。\n能撑下去，主要是因为你们两个真的每天都来，每个礼拜天对账，而且从来不借钱给瑞安。\n麻糬：“兄弟情也是爱。还有，我要一片原味煎饼。配鱼咖喱。免费。”",
  "Side Ending": "支线结局",
  "Rae, For Real": "瑞儿，真的",
  "Rae testified. The \"agency\" is gone, and so is Mr. G. She works at a café now, studies at night, and gives talks to younger students about scam scripts.\nYou're friends. Real ones, with boundaries. She says you were the first person who helped her without trying to buy her.": "瑞儿出庭作证了。那间“公司”没了，G先生也是。她现在在一间咖啡馆上班，晚上读书，还会去跟学弟学妹讲骗局的剧本。\n你们是朋友。真的那种，有界线的。她说你是第一个帮她、却没有想“买”她的人。",
  "Secret Ending": "隐藏结局",
  "Mochi Graduates": "麻糬毕业了",
  "Almost every page of the notebook is filled. Mochi closes it, adjusts her tiny glasses, and passes her Love Guide exam with distinction.\n\"Thank you, rookie. You were my thesis.\" She thinks about it. \"Your mistakes were very educational. Some were also very funny.\"": "笔记本几乎每一页都写满了。麻糬把它合上，推了推小眼镜，以优等成绩通过了她的恋爱指南考试。\n“谢谢你，菜鸟。你是我的毕业论文。”她想了想。“你犯的错很有教育意义。有些也很好笑。”"
